{"id":"n85881-1-9","stage":3,"title":"호두 · 核桃","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85881-1-9-1","ko":"멸치볶음이 엄청 고소하고 맛있어요.","zh":"这道炒小鳀鱼真香，真好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"멸치볶음이","meaning":"炒鳀鱼","explanation":"멸치볶음：炒鳀鱼；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"멸치볶음","audio":"/audio/baf7111a651b4acb83ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93770","senseId":"1","lemma":"멸치볶음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄청","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청：相当，特别","readings":[{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67346","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고소하고","meaning":"香，香喷喷","explanation":"고소하다：香，香喷喷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"고소하다","audio":"/audio/4f40403c6a05970822b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17967","senseId":"1","lemma":"고소하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있어요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"baf7111a651b4acb","term":"멸치볶음","zh":"炒鳀鱼","audio":"/audio/baf7111a651b4acb83ca.mp3","entryId":"93770","definition":"将鳀鱼放入酱油、糖稀等调料中翻炒而成的菜肴。","pronunciation":["멸치보끔"]},{"id":"31ff8e60cae7be0a","term":"엄청","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3","entryId":"67346","definition":"量或程度十分过分地。","pronunciation":["엄청"]},{"id":"4f40403c6a059708","term":"고소하다","zh":"香，香喷喷","audio":"/audio/4f40403c6a05970822b7.mp3","entryId":"17967","definition":"有和炒芝麻或现烤面包的气味或味道一样的感觉。","pronunciation":["고소하다"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/221d80ae1c13f1891593.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85881-1-9-2","ko":"호두를 넣어서 그래요.","